<description>&lt;p&gt;The Myanmar army seized a key resistance headquarters and ten opposition bases, while also tightening rice shipment controls on the Taungoo-Leiktho route. The junta is courting US investment in rare-earth mining and the US held private talks with the military authorities, as China remains dependent on Myanmar’s rare-earth supply. Gulf countries established a new joint military headquarters in Kuwait, linking regional actors to the conflict. ASEAN members continue debating reintegration of Myanmar despite the ongoing civil war. There were 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOdlMtZzUxWkhvOGh0UkJNV0lGSXJpV1dRa3liRFk1ODBMUXJEbHpoZUF1d1VheDdUeTlqVzJweGhqQlFMaE0tUm0wanV0OHkxT0FkQjhrSmxjYkJLbHFIRlFCeVZ0Z2xuV2YwazY3Z3FCOXRMVmhJbTNUU05xV21MeHdJNXJjLTBSR1FpU2lIamZDSkp6dXMzRWhzRV9lSjdMQkduckFzVU1oUzdJRG81dnBDaGVxVGUwUkozYlBkcDJQUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPZl9XaGdMNHJBNTVxcTNBOG1TWW5iRlllRmExM0o5Y2VCT0llS1ZuZGxRV1lZcTNDUGQyMjFQSlhYajQwNUxVQ0xRSldHU3NzRjdDdmFjMm9sdUlVMm1pN2NxM19zZkVaT1hzMlJETVF4R0tEZlF0MkFVV0I5T0I0WEo1c0wyZGEtaVZub2dOMXRqYmV2ekdnMUp2alZCT3FuMHcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Business &amp;amp; Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi--?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPRFB5THpraEhXZ1ZMNjJXTkh1bS1sdmR1ZmpoenZYcUR0VzgxLVgtTklZNzA1Q3pPalM1MFBPcmlWQktRM2o0cnRZalN2UXNCWG9kd0dWM082eUI2UVdlMUs3SFVVV0RDUHNId0lFampsZ2VzNDAwUE9ISTBET04yX3pKYnpYNUlVM0kwNDhXUkVVMFFyM0hITDU5Mmo0ZzNqT083ZEloaEpPUDc0RHpDanp2THh2M